  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Sector Support Project 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve education quality by improving the conditions and processes of teaching and learning at the school level, and the capacity for education service delivery across the education system by: (i) increasing the number of qualified teachers, (ii) improving the capacity and the quality of education service delivery by fostering community participation and by strengthening the management of human and financial resources at district and primary school levels, and (iii) improving learning outcomes at all levels by providing enhanced conditions for school effectiveness that will contribute to changes in the behaviors of teachers and students.  This project is considered a bridging operation consolidating policies and building the foundation for a broader sector program.</narrative>
  </description>
